  "abstract": "Covers DMARC as revised by DMARCbis: RFC 9989 for the _dmarc policy record, identifier alignment, the DNS Tree Walk for Organizational Domain and policy discovery, receiver evaluation and enforcement, with RFC 9990 aggregate reporting and RFC 9991 failure reporting. It lists three version lines: RFC 9989 (current, covering RFC 9990 and RFC 9991, all May 2026), and RFC 7489 and RFC 9091 (legacy, upgraded from). SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions and upgrades, the record and its tags, alignment and the tree walk with receiver behaviour, reporting and privacy, and the rollout to enforcement.",
